## Rollout
1. Apply Change 1 in `app-development` first (`terraform plan`/`apply` in `environments/app-development/infra`), then `app-production`.
2. Run Change 2 + 3 `az` one-shots.
3. Re-run the Vanta Azure integration sync; confirm test flips to passing (20/20).

Impact: none expected — no SMB file shares are mounted anywhere (the sole file share is NFS); blob/tfstate/queue traffic is unaffected by SMB version.
